Package: leoRtools
Title: Personal Tools for Data Analysis and Teaching
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Leonardo", "Gualano", email = "leo.gualano@intech.gov.ar", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of functions for statistical analysis and teaching:
    graphical and formal checks of the assumptions of linear models (lm, aov)
    and of models fitted with 'nlme' (gls, lme), the Rahman-Govindarajulu
    modification of the Shapiro-Wilk normality test with Monte Carlo
    p-values, and a simulated wheat dataset for teaching.
